  "title": "Light Chicken Piccata",
  "description": "This light version of chicken piccata features chicken breasts marinated in yogurt, then fried in margarine and olive oil, and finished in vermouth and lemon juice sauce with capers.",
  "authors": [
    "KBJORNSTAD"
  ],
